# No production signing key is shipped.
# Generate one on the catalog server:
#   vital-market keygen --private /etc/vital/market.key --public /usr/share/vitalos/marketplace/catalog.pub
# Install that public file into the image, then set catalog_url in
# /etc/vital/marketplace.conf. Until a real public key is here, the
# Marketplace app uses the bundled catalog and refuses unsigned remote catalogs.
